evidence('6-023','Describe the energy-transfer directions inferred from these records: device X runs a lamp while its chemicals react, without an external power supply; device Y produces new chemicals only while connected to a DC supply.','X converts chemical energy to electrical output; Y uses electrical input to drive chemical change.','X direction inferred from lamp output without external power (1).|Y direction inferred from dependence on electrical supply (1).')
